  "description": "# 🎗 Mystic Alliance\nEST. September 4, 2024 | Created on January 3, 2025\n## Who are we?\n \nMystic Alliance is a community-driven guild group, dedicated to exploring the vast expanse of **[IdleMMO]**. Our members are passionate players who value teamwork, strategy, and camaraderie. We strive to create a welcoming environment for players of all skill levels, fostering growth and collaboration.  \n\n### Trainer Guild\nThis guild tries to give you a more relaxed experience and allows you to access the alliance resource along your journey as a beginner in immo. Level at your pace and get a feeling for guild tasks. Later on, you can join higher guilds from the Alliance (Vanguard/Crusader/Dawn).\n\n## ⌛️ Raids\n- none... Currently saving marks and recruiting \n## 🔆 Requirements\n- ### ⚔️ Any Level | Any Class\n- 💬 Respectful communication and behaviour\n- 📖 Willingness to learn and improve\n\n## 🎁 Benefits\n- 🤖 World boss notification bot\n- 🗂️ Collection of resources\n- 🔧 Forging and Alchemy services\n- 🎁 Giveaways (Tools, Gear, Mats, Membership,...)\n- 🪙 Public market with lower prices\n\n## 🏛 Guilds\n- Mystic Vanguard\n- Mystic Crusader\n- Mystic Dawn [Skiller]\n- Mystic Wayfarer [Trainer]\n- Mystic Abyss [Cursed]\n\n## ⭕️ Application via Discord\n#### https://discord.gg/Ndz4eNPECy\n\nVisit the server, enter the queue and\n# ❇️ JOIN US NOW",
